{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "e7f6455e0a52066d03fe0e381227bda0eb4a4a5a3aa8c8f767d248299ad2e797", "ja": "ハニー！　おかえりなさいなのー！", "zh": "HONEY！欢迎回来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ee4acc76c96227433ae73cea29d7461f097068c27b69e3dbfc7754aed2ccf456", "ja": "うわっ、美希！？　まだ残ってたのか……。\nっていうか、大きな声でその呼び方はダメだって。", "zh": "哇，美希！？你还没走啊……\n还有，就说了不能那样大声叫我啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "fa6562717fc2cd6550894b1dd4fa139ac7e216f4ee55b4faa50f5fb347724810", "ja": "誰かに聞かれたら誤解されるから、でしょ？\nでも、今ならふたりっきりだから平気なの☆", "zh": "因为别人听见会产生误会，对吧？\n不过现在只有我们两个在，所以不要紧的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1005_p", "source_sha256": "35906fdb2a3b3238f2f3e6fad3ca7c87b7c5e1817e77b409aa980cb03bddefd0", "ja": "なるほど。それならいい……\nいや、そもそもよくないんだけどな？", "zh": "原来如此，那就没关系……\n不对，本来就不该这样叫喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "64b8a3b57d7740d9ccd8b53fd065d36d8fd595481f16253b474f43ca505c826f", "ja": "それよりハニー、お仕事、お疲れさまでしたなの！\nお風呂にする？　おにぎりにする？　それとも～？", "zh": "先别说这个了HONEY，工作辛苦了！\n要先洗澡吗？或者要先吃饭团呢？还是说～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "7434defd4320abaa20e73d4940cee976d0645d4f23b66c9387d4c3da7251069a", "ja": "やん、ハニーのエッチ！　あはっ☆", "zh": "讨厌，HONEY你好色！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2a20bb94e215b39cc946f1fc12aef14348d1409f4faaf6d19dc38ca4a756d64a", "ja": "いや、俺は何も……というか、どうしたんだ？\n今日は特にテンションが高くないか？", "zh": "不，我什么都没说……话说你是怎么啦？\n今天是不是特别亢奋啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "ce8471bc9250ce71bf7d6b5d0bf763f93a75b0105c40913e67b420c982a1112f", "ja": "だってミキ、今日のお仕事で、ウェディングドレス\n着たでしょ？　だから～、すっごく新婚さん気分なの☆", "zh": "因为美希今天工作时，不是穿了婚纱吗？\n所以啊～现在很有新婚夫妻的感觉☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "6a8bc8657a7828ef244a75d54bbd833f1290a8564c38c695dcfcb166c1dbf1e8", "ja": "とゆーわけで、新婚さんごっこ、しよ？\nね、決まりなの！　それじゃ最初から、もう一回ね♪", "zh": "所以说，我们来扮演新婚夫妇吧？\n好嘛，就这么决定啰！那么就从头开始再来一次喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "37173f051924aac2e592a2a8303e833a7877a317bd59867d693fe9a8866b28b3", "ja": "いやでも、もう遅い時間だし。\n明日もあるんだから……。", "zh": "可是现在已经很晚了，\n明天也还有工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "dad8ea14fe64161af9a7b470e808243b55cb001141e0e99a341a39d3afad7563", "ja": "パーンパーカパーン♪\nパーンパーカパーン♪", "zh": "当当～当当～♪\n当当～当当～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5448c3c5ad1ced19dea0d8388210760910f5150682e50e9e39d0f668bd16b592", "ja": "というか、最初ってそこからなのか……。", "zh": "话说你所谓的从头，原来是从那里开始吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "e186984b8c5ab58758a0c150494ecb550e6df0217e9de00e60578b74a755f1db", "ja": "ぐすっ。ハニー、今までミキを育ててくれて、\nありがとうございましたなの……。", "zh": "呜呜。HONEY，谢谢你至今为止，\n对美希的养育之恩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aa79a43f61ec0d198850b41982ffaf4e16a1b69254e24d25dd121742e2ac523e", "ja": "あ、ああ……まさかの父親役だったけど、まあいい。\n幸せになるんだぞ？", "zh": "呃，嗯……没想到我是饰演父亲，也无所谓啦。\n你要幸福喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "7296eae91df60cb99ab94559046f8eb3f6a5ecf44328795873ab9e98a5631c10", "ja": "うんっ、お待たせハニー！\nミキを末永く、お幸せにしてね？　あはっ☆", "zh": "嗯，让你久等了HONEY！\n你要让美希永远幸福喔！啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1017_p", "source_sha256": "989963763240073a625dea5cd8862c9790dde9bb1396733c05761013401b7b64", "ja": "……もう誰役でもいいけど、\nそれは自分で言うセリフじゃないからな？", "zh": "……不管要我演谁都无所谓了，\n但你那句台词可不该由自己来说喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "fc855cd802fb70735ec55e01143a08e96c0e95dcf2b3c6a5b69818d50d8befab", "ja": "細かいコトは、気にしなくていいって思うな♪\nほらほらハニー、早く腕、組んで組んでっ。", "zh": "美希觉得不用在意那种小细节啦♪\n来来HONEY，快来勾着手臂吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "59499f91b5788a489d74a977585c06e67450899dfae23b87ef1fb15f2977d6f6", "ja": "レッドカーペットは、エントランスにあるよね？\nつきあたりまで二人で歩いて、後は誓いの……あはっ☆", "zh": "大厅应该有红地毯吧？\n两人一起走到尽头，然后就是誓约之……啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0054_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bc58f98c5572b1f4c97842cd431d62692c3224fea5fc3effa41b23e266d9dd85", "ja": "（すっかり花嫁気分に染まってしまったらしい。\n仲人役は……いや建設的に考えてる場合じゃない！）", "zh": "（她好像完全沉浸在新娘的氛围里了。\n谁来演媒人……不，现在不是积极配合她思考的时候！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
